vesktop (1.7.2-1nano) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release
  [Upstream]
    * 1.7.2
      - Fixed missing metainfo
    * 1.7.1
      - Fixed Keybinds causing a freeze on Flatpak X11
      - Fixed the Keybinds page crashing
      - Fixed hardware encoded Streams not loading for some viewers. Try turning on Video
        Hardware Encoding in settings and see if it works. It will considerably increase
        stream quality and reduce CPU usage
      - Fixed relaunch not working properly
      - Now better handles Vencord startup errors & offers to update Vencord

 -- Christopher Roy Bratusek <nano@jpberlin.de>  Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:15:57 +0100

